{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"652","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"1","news_title":"提倡私部門企業誠信 修正「上市上櫃公司誠信經營守則」","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">發布時間︰民國<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\"> 108</span>年<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">05</span>月<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">24</span>日<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\"> 17:20</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">為實踐<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">2018</span>年聯合國反貪腐公約國際審查所研提之結論性意見，並配合主管機關政風單位推動「提倡私部門企業誠信」之廉政政策目標，證交所依據主管機關廉政會報決議，參酌國際標準組織<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">(International<span style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Organization for Standardization</span>，簡稱<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">ISO)</span>公布之<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">ISO 37001</span>企業反賄賂管理機制<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">(Anti-bribery<span style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>management systems)</span>，修正「上市上櫃公司誠信經營守則」，於<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">108</span>年<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">5</span>月<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">23</span>日公告實施，強化國際接軌，並作為上市上櫃公司推廣誠信經營反貪腐之參考依據。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">證交所參考<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">ISO 37001</span>企業反賄賂管理機制，修正「上市上櫃公司誠信經營守則」，俾使上市上櫃公司落實誠信、正直等核心價值之具體作為更加完善，本次修正重點說明如下：</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">一、制定以誠信為基礎之政策，經董事會通過。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">二、建立不誠信行為風險之評估機制，定期分析及評估營業範圍內具較高不誠信行為風險之營業活動，據以訂定防範方案並定期檢討防範方案之妥適性與有效性。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">三、要求董事與高階管理階層出具遵循誠信經營政策之聲明，並於僱用條件要求受僱人遵守誠信經營政策。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">四、針對誠信經營政策、聲明、承諾及執行，應製作文件化資訊並妥善保存。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">五、誠信經營專責單位配置充足之資源及適任之人員，就其所掌理事項，至少一年一次向董事會報告。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">六、依不誠信行為風險之評估結果，擬訂相關稽核計畫，並據以查核防範方案遵循情形。查核結果應通報高階管理階層及誠信經營專責單位，並作成稽核報告提報董事會。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">七、具體檢舉制度應涵蓋的內容，包括：訂定檢舉案件調查完成後，依照情節輕重所應採取之後續措施，必要時應向主管機關報告或移送司法機關偵辦；允許匿名檢舉。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">資料來源：證交所新聞<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">http://www.twse.com.tw/zh/news/newsDetail/ff8080816aafdf4c016ae9243582014a</span></span></p>\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2019-05-30","clk_count":"195"}},"__N_SSG":true}